<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_subsection">A.3 Hyperparameters</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide the standard hyperparameter choices for experiments in Table <a href="#A1.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Natively Unlearnable Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> and the NULLs-specific hyperparameters for the Wikipedia setting in Table <a href="#A1.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Natively Unlearnable Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>.</p>
</div>
